4ff645904952"],

Cell["\<\
The  box variable indicates a boxed region in these plots where there is a \
sign change.  MMA will then use a root-finding method that is guaranteed to \
converge to the boxed root.

Because of prior experience, we know the style of locomotion each boxed root \
represents.  The types are
----------------------------------------------
bu    brachiating under the surface
bo    brachiating on top of the surface
wu    walking under the surface
wo    walking on top of the surface
----------------------------------------------
The logic behind this type of partitioning is covered in Rosa and Lynch 2013.\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9886356357674217`*^9, 3.988635680866194*^9}, {
  3.988635739994524*^9, 
  3.988635865109724*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1141cdc6-34f7-4464-8ffe-\
bf1d92a270e5"],

